        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Please note the Governance Programme accepts a broad definition of governance that includes the management of populations, economies, societies, and ecological environments by state actors and institutions, international organisations, non-governmental actors and institutions, political groups, informal economies and politics, non-state actors, civil society groups, and others."
            }
