        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "*Deliverables can be submitted in other languages, such as Dari and Pashto, and will be translated into English. Deliverables will be made public and open access on the Governance Programme's webpages."
            },
